Wording is verbatim with two deliberate proper-noun corrections:
the spoken "Blue Grid Lane Solutions" is captioned "BlueGrid Land
Solutions", and "lane clearing" is captioned "land clearing" — the
company name and a named service, both misheard the same way
because a final /d/ before /s/ and /k/ goes unreleased.
